                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "In scientific literature, our species is categorized under the biological genus <w>Homo</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "在科学文献中，我们这一物种被归类于生物学上的<w>人属</w>。"
                            }
